BeatNet
-------
BeatNet is the beat, downbeat, tempo, and meter analysis model by Mojtaba
Heydari. The model and any converted model derived from it are licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
Source: https://github.com/mjhydri/BeatNet
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

When distributing a BeatNet model or a conversion, retain attribution, the
license link, and a description of changes as required by CC BY 4.0.

Mei includes a conversion of BeatNet's generic `model_1_weights.pt` network.
The PyTorch model was exported to an ONNX opset 17 model with a fixed
`1 x 1600 x 272` (32-second) input. It returns beat and downbeat activation
probabilities; feature extraction and temporal decoding run in Mei.

